# Source: https://genome.ucsc.edu/FAQ/FAQformat.html#format1
# Symptom: a fully-specified BED12 record with all fields at valid boundaries:
#   - score = 1000 (maximum valid)
#   - blockCount = 3
#   - blockSizes and blockStarts correctly formatted (trailing comma)
#   - thickStart == chromStart (entire feature is thick)
#   - thickEnd == chromEnd (entire feature is thick)
#   - itemRgb = "0,0,255" (valid R,G,B triplet)
#   - first blockStart = 0 (required)
#   - last blockStart + blockSize = chromEnd - chromStart (exactly touches end)
#   Strict validators that reject any of these boundary values are incorrect.
chr1	1000	2000	gene001	1000	+	1000	2000	0,0,255	3	200,300,100,	0,400,900,
